        "reason": "Cassandra Cain's signature gear. Increases Crit Damage, grants additional Crit Damage when she lands a critical hit, and boosts her Attack. Also restores her HP on crits and successful dodges.",
        "signature": true
      },
      {
        "id": "promethium_claws",
        "name": "Promethium Claws",
        "reason": "Grants a shield when HP is low. Cassandra Cain relies on dodges and crits for damage, and this Legacy Piece helps keep her alive through the burst window after her Ultimate, allowing her to fully capitalize on her dodge-triggered slashes.",
        "signature": false
      },
      {
        "id": "not_so_huge_hammer",
        "name": "Not-So-Huge Hammer",
        "reason": "Provides a well-rounded boost to HP, Attack, and Crit Damage. Cassandra Cain excels at explosive crit bursts, and the high Attack and Crit Damage bonuses greatly amplify both her dodge-triggered slashes and chained crit damage.",
        "signature": false
      },
      {
        "id": "razor_rib_umbrella",
        "name": "Razor Rib Umbrella",
        "reason": "Grants basic HP and Attack bonuses. Cassandra Cain benefits from both the added survivability and the boost to base damage, making this Legacy Piece a solid transitional option for the early to mid game.",
